  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm/A]\n[Bbmaj7]\n[Dm/A]\n[Bbmaj7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm/A]Grey skies\n[Bb]clouding up the things\nwe used to see\n[Dm/A]with wide eyes\n[Bb]Maybe everything\nwas meant to be\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]this way\nWill it\n[F/E]ever change\nBut\n[G9]are we stuck\nhere on our own\n[Bb]\n[Bbm]\nIt's all gone\n\n[Interlude]\n[Dm/A]grey\n[Bbmaj7]\nIt's all gone\n[Dm/A]grey\n[Bbmaj7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm/A]I found\n[Bb]telling you the truth\nthe hardest thing\n[Dm/A]to get out\nI\n[Bb]know it wasn't you\nthat made me\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]feel this way\nWill it\n[F/E]ever change\nOr\n[G9]are we stuck\nhere on our own.\n[Bb]\n[Bbm]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gm]And give it one\nmore try\n[Csus2]I don't know\nif I would stay\n[Dm]\nI feel so\n[Bb]much better now\n[F/A]\n[Gm]And baby begg-\ning me\n[Csus2]Will leave you so\nempty inside\n[Dm]\nSo you should-\n[Bb]n't even try\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Dm/A]I know\n[Bb]every last regret\ninside of me\n[Gm7]is my own\nThe\n[Bb]way I hold them close\nhas made me\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[F]be this way\nI will\n[F/E]never change\nI\n[G9]know I'm stuck\nhere on my own,\n[Bb]\nmy\n[Bbm]own\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gm]Given one more\ntry\n[Csus2]I don't know\nif I would stay\n[Dm]\nI feel so\n[Bb]much better now\n[F/A]\n[Gm]Where did we go\nwrong\n[Csus2]I know you still\nhold on to me\n[Dm]\nBut it's time\n[Bb]that you let go\n[Gm]I gave you things\nI had\n[Csus2]That I could not\nget back again\n[Dm]\nBut I'm bet-\n[Bb]ter off alone\nIt's all gone\n\n[Outro]\n[Dm/A]grey\n[Bbmaj7]\nIt's all gone\n[Dm/A]grey\n[Bbmaj7]\nIt's all gone\n[Dm/A]grey\n[C]\nIt's all gone\n[Gm]grey\n[Bb]\n[Dm]",
